# cancel it; access denied for another organisation's record

Start /enrolments
Scope /enrolments
Exclude /prototype /prototype-admin /assets
Tags manage CES-010 CES-014 CES-015

--- Setup ---

Use setup.clinician

--- Map ---

Visit /enrolments
